37333339323636","heroId":"204","skinId":"1466","skinName":"灵蛊蚀心","title":"移动喊话6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"出手不问善恶，唯三不医——剑客不医，君子不医，不死不医。","hasText":true,"duration":10.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/204/0653067E514991000183937333339323636.mp3"},{"id":"0610167E514991000183134303539373539","heroId":"204","skinId":"1466","skinName":"灵蛊蚀心","title":"移动喊话7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"蛇蝎畏真火，螫虫惧雄精。人心却不足，贪饕胜毒物。","hasText":true,"duration":10.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/204/0610167E514991000183134303539373539.mp3"},{"id":"0601067E514971000183135363332303738","heroId":"204","skinId":"1466","skinName":"灵蛊蚀心","title":"大厅喊话1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"于绝处逢生，自无间归来。南疆有良医，悬铃问武林。","hasText":true,"duration":18.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/204/0601067E514971000183135363332303738.mp3"},{"id":"0625867E514981000183435303939393730","heroId":"204","skinId":"1466","skinName":"灵蛊蚀心","title":"移动喊话3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"心与焦土同焚，命托蛇蛊寄生。","hasText":true,"duration":5.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/204/0625867E514981000183435303939393730.mp3"},{"id":"0686567E514991000183135303135343530","heroId":"204","skinId":"1466","skinName":"灵蛊蚀心","title":"移动喊话4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"今日白衣剑侠名扬天下，可还记得昔年南疆灵蛇谷？","hasText":true,"duration":7.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/204/0686567E514991000183135303135343530.mp3"},{"id":"0671767E514981000183134323335393238","heroId":"204","skinId":"1466","skinName":"灵蛊蚀心","title":"移动喊话1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"与蛊为伍便是邪禁，中原迂腐果如所料。","hasText":true,"duration":7.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/204/0671767E514981000183134323335393238.mp3"},{"id":"0691967E514981000183137393033373937","heroId":"204","skinId":"1466","skinName":"灵蛊蚀心","title":"大厅喊话3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"虎踞纹鼎翻覆是，炼药炼蛊更炼心。","hasText":true,"duration":15.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/204/0691967E51498100018313